# Candidate Finder — Optional Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: Candidate Finder defaults to 100% local, offline rule-based extraction.
# No API keys or external services are required for any core functionality.
#
# If you wish to use Groq AI-assisted extraction:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in this directory.
# 2. Add your Groq API key from https://console.groq.com/keys
# 3. Choose your desired model ID (default: openai/gpt-oss-120b).
# ==============================================================================

# GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Groq Model Identifier (can be updated here without modifying Python source code)
# Supported candidate: openai/gpt-oss-120b
# Other alternatives: llama-3.1-8b-instant, mixtral-8x7b-32768
GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
